# Build outputs are NOT committed - the source and the build scripts are the
# reviewable artifacts, and a binary in the tree is neither reviewable nor
# trustworthy. Rebuild whenever needed.
#   dist/          - the WPF app (build-wpf.ps1): installs, sets up, uninstalls
#   dist-winforms/ - the legacy WinForms console (build-app.ps1)
dist/
dist-winforms/
dist-wpf*/

# Local run transcripts - may contain real host/account/DB names, never commit
*-last-run.log

wpf/_probe.*
